WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.670
Mr. Brown: For the science project, you are going to work in pairs.

2
00:00:08.671 --> 00:00:11.955
Brian: Let's be partners.

3
00:00:11.956 --> 00:00:17.672
Veronica: Oh, Mr. Brown? Can I be partners with Richard?

4
00:00:17.673 --> 00:00:25.022
Mr. Brown: Richard? Oh, Ricky! Yes, of course.

5
00:00:25.023 --> 00:00:29.611
Ricky: I didn't know Veronica would choose me!

6
00:00:29.612 --> 00:00:32.804
Brian: Why didn't you say no, Ricky?

7
00:00:32.805 --> 00:00:37.893
Ricky: Uh, because, because . . .

8
00:00:37.894 --> 00:00:42.683
Veronica: Oh Richard. Carry my books home for me.

9
00:00:42.684 --> 00:00:45.674
Ricky: Uh, home?

10
00:00:45.675 --> 00:01:01.484
Veronica: Yes. We must get started on the project.

11
00:01:01.485 --> 00:01:07.396
Ricky: Yum. These are so good.

12
00:01:07.397 --> 00:01:12.403
Veronica: Those cookies are from France.

13
00:01:12.404 --> 00:01:15.612
Victor: Hey, who's this?

14
00:01:15.613 --> 00:01:19.270
Veronica: Richard, this is my brother, Victor.

15
00:01:19.271 --> 00:01:22.466
Ricky: Hello.

16
00:01:22.467 --> 00:01:27.874
Victor: Hey, Ricky. Do you want to play my new game?

17
00:01:27.875 --> 00:01:37.666
Ricky: Yeah, cool.

18
00:01:37.667 --> 00:01:42.101
Ricky: Uh-oh, I think I have to go.

19
00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:44.868
Victor: Let's just play one more time.

20
00:01:44.869 --> 00:01:50.584
Ricky: Okay.

